Third-party content redistributed in this repository:

* data/n5.csv, data/n4.csv — vocabulary lists from
  https://github.com/jamsinclair/open-anki-jlpt-decks (MIT License),
  themselves derived from the lists at tanos.co.uk, which reconstruct the
  withdrawn 2004 JLPT Test Content Specification (出題基準). These lists are
  UNOFFICIAL: the JLPT has published no syllabus since 2010.

* src/fsrs.ts — FSRS-6 scheduler ported from
  https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/py-fsrs (MIT License).
